# Kill switch — controls outbound routing for the Conversion Engine.
# CLAUSE: When KILL_SWITCH is unset (empty) or set to any value other than "enabled",
#   ALL outbound email, SMS, and voice traffic is routed to the Staff Sink.
#   No real or synthetic prospect is contacted.
# To enable live outbound (requires executive approval): set KILL_SWITCH=enabled
KILL_SWITCH=

# HubSpot
HUBSPOT_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# Cal.com
CAL_API_KEY=
CAL_BASE_URL=https://api.cal.com

# Email (Resend)
RESEND_API_KEY=

# SMS (Africa's Talking sandbox)
AT_API_KEY=
AT_USERNAME=sandbox

# Staff sink (all outbound routed here when KILL_SWITCH is unset)
STAFF_SINK_EMAIL=
STAFF_SINK_PHONE=
WEBHOOK_BASE_URL=https://conversion-engine-l27z.onrender.com
Register this URL across all four integrations:
  Resend reply webhook      → $WEBHOOK_BASE_URL/webhooks/email
  Africa's Talking callback → $WEBHOOK_BASE_URL/webhooks/sms
  Cal.com booking events    → $WEBHOOK_BASE_URL/webhooks/cal
  HubSpot timeline events   → $WEBHOOK_BASE_URL/webhooks/hubspot

